    "For each body,F=alpha integral(q)dS and T=alpha integral(r cross q)dS. A pure double layer cannot carry net F or T.",
    "The exterior double layer annihilates per-body rigid-motion traces. As alpha tends to zero, 1/alpha growth can lie in this smooth completion subspace; large density amplitude alone does not prove poor spatial resolution.",
